          "type": "text",
          "text": "Safety officers considered restricted transport access while preparing a replacement design for the coastal water tank. Pipe connections occupy part of the coastal tank platform. A later inspection will compare the finished dimensions with this record. A right pyramid has a rectangular base 5 cm by 5 cm and perpendicular height 9 cm. Find its volume in cm³."
        }
      ],
